      "text": "DERP is also the bootstrap path (traffic starts here while direct paths are probed) and the fallback when direct fails.\nTo a firewall it looks like ordinary HTTPS (an HTTP Upgrade, which \"looks exactly like WebSockets\" per Tailscale's source).",
